# GitHub Basics 🐙

## Key Features
Repository → store code
Issues     → track bugs
Pull Request → review code
Actions    → automation
Pages      → free website

## Pull Request Steps
1. Create branch
2. Make changes
3. Push branch
4. Open PR on GitHub
5. Review & merge ✅

## Important
Git  = tool on your PC
GitHub = website for code

## Profile Tips
✅ Pin best repos
✅ Write good README
✅ Commit daily = green squares
✅ Add topics to repos
